{
    "title": "Gin Rummy Plus: Fun Card Game",
    "description": "Join the world\u2019s most popular Gin Rummy Game and play live with millions of real players. Playing Gin Rummy with friends, family, and millions of players worldwide has never been easier! Join one of the largest free online gaming communities and enjoy an all-new free multiplayer experience and competitive leaderboards.\r\n\r\nYou can now explore exciting Gin Rummy Plus more than canasta games, patti game or play cribbage with friends! Try your hand at rummy 21 card for a fresh challenge. Satisfy your competitive spirit with the popular Gin Rummy Plus game with card multiplayer attraction that'll keep you hooked.\r\n\r\nSPECIAL FEATURES\r\n\r\n\u2660 PLAY FOR FREE - Experience all features totally free.\r\n\u2660 CARD PLAY GAME - Immerse in an environment that celebrates all types of card games, from gin rummy extra to the traditional tash wala game.\r\n\r\n\u2660 ENJOY UNIQUE MULTIPLAYER MODE - Compete with hundreds of thousands of elite Gin Rummy players worldwide and prove you\u2019re the leaderboard champion.\r\n\r\n\u2660 PROGRESSIVE JACKPOTS - Double Your Gin Rummy Fun with the biggest win of your life!\r\n\r\n\u2660 PLAYING CARDS VARIETIES - Enjoy a dynamic gaming experience with different card types like the exciting higher or lower card.\r\n\r\n\u2660 PLAY WITH BUDDIES - Invite your friends and have much more fun anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\n\u2660 SOCIAL EXPERIENCE - Play with your friends or make new ones, Gin Rummy Plus has the strongest community of any Gin Rummy game; including classic rummy, regal rummy etc.\r\n\r\n\u2660 LEADERBOARDS - See how you stack up against other players or your friends.\r\n\r\n\u2660 FREE BONUSES - Countless opportunities to earn free coins, easier than ever!\r\n\r\nExperience a variety of high-quality Gin Rummy Lounges for ultimate fun like never before!\r\n\r\nAdditional information:\r\n \r\n\u2022  Gin Rummy Plus is FREE to download and includes optional in-game purchases (including random items). Information about drop rates for random item purchases can be found in-game. If you wish to disable in-game purchases, please turn off the in-app purchases in your phone or tablet\u2019s Settings.\r\n\r\n\u2022        Use of this application is governed by Zynga\u2019s Terms of Service, found at http://m.zynga.com/legal/terms-of-service.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join the world\u2019s most popular Gin Rummy Game and play live with millions of real players. Playing Gin Rummy with friends, family, and millions of players worldwide has never been easier! Join one of the largest free online gaming communities and enjoy an all-new free multiplayer experience and competitive leaderboards.<br><br>You can now explore exciting Gin Rummy Plus more than canasta games, patti game or play cribbage with friends! Try your hand at rummy 21 card for a fresh challenge. Satisfy your competitive spirit with the popular Gin Rummy Plus game with card multiplayer attraction that&#39;ll keep you hooked.<br><br>SPECIAL FEATURES<br><br>\u2660 PLAY FOR FREE - Experience all features totally free.<br>\u2660 CARD PLAY GAME - Immerse in an environment that celebrates all types of card games, from gin rummy extra to the traditional tash wala game.<br><br>\u2660 ENJOY UNIQUE MULTIPLAYER MODE - Compete with hundreds of thousands of elite Gin Rummy players worldwide and prove you\u2019re the leaderboard champion.<br><br>\u2660 PROGRESSIVE JACKPOTS - Double Your Gin Rummy Fun with the biggest win of your life!<br><br>\u2660 PLAYING CARDS VARIETIES - Enjoy a dynamic gaming experience with different card types like the exciting higher or lower card.<br><br>\u2660 PLAY WITH BUDDIES - Invite your friends and have much more fun anytime, anywhere.<br><br>\u2660 SOCIAL EXPERIENCE - Play with your friends or make new ones, Gin Rummy Plus has the strongest community of any Gin Rummy game; including classic rummy, regal rummy etc.<br><br>\u2660 LEADERBOARDS - See how you stack up against other players or your friends.<br><br>\u2660 FREE BONUSES - Countless opportunities to earn free coins, easier than ever!<br><br>Experience a variety of high-quality Gin Rummy Lounges for ultimate fun like never before!<br><br>Additional information:<br> <br>\u2022  Gin Rummy Plus is FREE to download and includes optional in-game purchases (including random item